OL,3,APM to meet pub bombings families in new
OL,4,Ayear
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaturday marks the 52nd anniversary of
OL,7,Fthe atrocity when two bombs exploded in
OL,8,Fthe Mulberry Bush and Tavern in the
OL,9,FTown pubs in the city centre, killing
OL,10,F21 people and injuring 220. No-one has
OL,11,Fbeen convicted over the murders.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
